{"id":"356609ae6539b190e03272302a92439a1241c4e9","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236559","title":"Codex 又要重置了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"nanoxx","excerpt":"OpenAI - @nanoxx - Tibo • @thsottiaux•19 分钟Update on rate limits in Codex.We've found (a) some inefficiencies w","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>Tibo • @<a href=\"/member/thsottiaux\">thsottiaux</a>•19 分钟</p>\n<p>Update on rate limits in Codex.</p>\n<p>We've found (a) some inefficiencies when using images in long sessions with multiple compactions (b) high p95+ usage for Computer History (c) a feature that was meant to generate conversation titles that was draining a bit more usage than intended. And we have a tiger team combing through everything and shipping fixes tomorrow. We also found a novel approach to drive efficiency up significantly that is completely unrelated and we will be working on next week.</p>\n<p><strong>As part of some of the fixes tomorrow, we will also do a full reset of the usage for all paid subscriptions.</strong></p>\n<p>See you then.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18007395\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a1eb9cbe38956f3c76073e6c5de524db?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Eosdivus\" data-uid=\"840657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Eosdivus\">Eosdivus</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-23 14:34:10 +08:00\">22h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>“Reset will land around 14pm PST tomorrow.”我没算错的话，重置时间是北京时间 25 号凌晨 5 点？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n     